{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41560","headline":"芍药 · 张泌","name":"芍药","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香清粉澹怨残春，蝶翅蜂须恋蘂尘。\n闲倚晚风生怅望，静留迟日学因循。\n休将薜荔爲青琐，好与玫瑰作近邻。\n零落若教随暮雨，又应愁杀别离人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张泌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}